  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposal, by reason of its inappropriate design, most notably the removal of the chimney turrets, the amended parapet design, and the altered recessed window detailing, would result in a poor architectural response to the site. The development would fail to be sympathetic or compatible to the prevailing character of the surrounding area and would represent an incongruous and inappropriate form of development. It would fail to maintain the high quality of the approved scheme or to enhance the character and appearance of the site and its wider context. As such, the proposal is contrary to London Plan Policy D4, Local Plan Policies CC1 and CC2, and the objectives of the National Planning Policy Framework."
  ],
